# viewport 1280x800
until 300 REWRITE THE FUTURE
click REWRITE THE FUTURE
frames 90
save motion-idle
hold KeyD
frames 18
save motion-run-a
frames 7
save motion-run-b
key Space 9
save motion-jump
frames 28
save motion-fall
hold Space
frames 8
save motion-glide
key KeyX 1
frames 2
save motion-cry
release Space
release KeyD
frames 90
save motion-land
